**Rules shown:** no sticky sessions, health on `/api/ready`, request body cap 50 MB, draining 30 s, retry only idempotent GET, proxy protocol on if Cloudflare fronts.

**Parent:** L0. **Child:** L2 (zoom into `API_Pool` and `Worker_Pool`).
